            "review_title": "Review at Sandals At Citadines Marina Halong",
            "review_text": "BeanettaLangkawi\nLondon, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nGood food. Great staff.\nOct 2024 • Couples\nSandals is a lovely restaurant that is located in the Citadines Marina. We had fish and chips, ratatouille and mashed potatoes! Prices are fair but they do add a 10% service charge and a 10% vat to the total. \nThe ratatouille is delicious and the mash was the smoothest and creamiest I have ever eaten. I could eat it over and over. The fish and chips was just okay. \nOur server Thuong Vu was very helpful and knowledgeable about the menu.\nWritten October 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
