            "review_title": "Review at Sandals At Citadines Marina Halong",
            "review_text": "Hanh T\n12 contributions\n0\nVery pleasant\nJan 2023 • Family\nThe restaurant is on the 3rd floor of Citadines Marina Halong, serving Western food. The food, music, design, staff are all great.\nWe tried seafood pizza, pumpkin soup, spaghetti and our kid loved them all. \nThere were a few constructions in the neighborhood, but we still enjoyed seaview and lots of sunlight during lunchtime. \nOh, and the outdoor pool is just at the door so you can actually enjoy sunbath after lunch. We didnt do it as it was cold on the day we arrived.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2023",
